```turtle
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/ontology#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .

ex:Scene1 a ex:DrivingScene ;
    ex:hasWeatherCondition ex:HeavyFog ;
    ex:hasTimeStamp "2023-10-05T14:30:00"^^xsd:dateTime .

ex:HeavyFog a ex:WeatherCondition ;
    ex:visibilityRange 50^^ex:Meter ;
    ex:conditionType "Fog" .

ex:Vehicle1 a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:hasColor "Black" ;
    ex:hasPosition ex:Position1 ;
    ex:hasSpeed 20^^ex:KilometersPerHour ;
    ex:isDrivingIn ex:Lane1 .

ex:Position1 a ex:Position ;
    ex:latitude 40.7128 ;
    ex:longitude -74.0060 ;
    ex:distanceFromCamera 10^^ex:Meter .

ex:Lane1 a ex:RoadLane ;
    ex:laneNumber 1 ;
    ex:laneType "Driving" .

ex:Ambulance a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:hasColor "White" ;
    ex:hasPosition ex:Position2 ;
    ex:hasSpeed 30^^ex:KilometersPerHour ;
    ex:isDrivingIn ex:Lane2 ;
    ex:hasEmergencyLights true .

ex:Position2 a ex:Position ;
    ex:latitude 40.7127 ;
    ex:longitude -74.0062 ;
    ex:distanceFromCamera 100^^ex:Meter .

ex:Lane2 a ex:RoadLane ;
    ex:laneNumber 2 ;
    ex:laneType "Driving" .

ex:Building1 a ex:Building ;
    ex:hasPosition ex:Position3 .

ex:Position3 a ex:Position ;
    ex:latitude 40.7129 ;
    ex:longitude -74.0061 ;
    ex:distanceFromCamera 150^^ex:Meter .

ex:RoadInfrastructure1 a ex:RoadInfrastructure ;
    ex:hasType "TrafficLight" ;
    ex:hasPosition ex:Position4 .

ex:Position4 a ex:Position ;
    ex:latitude 40.7128 ;
    ex:longitude -74.0063 ;
    ex:distanceFromCamera 120^^ex:Meter .

ex:Vehicle1 ex:isFollowing ex:Ambulance .
ex:Ambulance ex:isApproaching ex:Building1 .
ex:Vehicle1 ex:isOccludedBy ex:HeavyFog .
ex:Ambulance ex:isOccludedBy ex:HeavyFog .
ex:RoadInfrastructure1 ex:isOccludedBy ex:HeavyFog .
```

```
Identified Risks for each risk class
```

**Risk 1:**
Description: Reduced visibility due to heavy fog, leading to potential misidentification or late detection of the ambulance and other vehicles.
Severity Score: 0.9

**Risk 2:**
Description: The autonomous vehicle (Vehicle1) is following an ambulance (Ambulance) in heavy fog conditions, which may lead to delayed reaction times and increased risk of collision.
Severity Score: 0.85

**Risk 3:**
Description: Occlusion of road infrastructure (e.g., traffic lights) by heavy fog, leading to potential failure in recognizing and responding to traffic signals.
Severity Score: 0.8

**Risk 4:**
Description: Misjudgment of distance and speed of surrounding vehicles due to poor visibility, increasing the risk of unsafe maneuvers.
Severity Score: 0.85

**Risk 5:**
Description: Potential for pedestrians or cyclists to be obscured by fog, leading to unexpected crossing or presence in the roadway.
Severity Score: 0.9

**Risk 6:**
Description: The autonomous vehicle's sensors may struggle to accurately detect and classify objects in low-visibility conditions, leading to potential errors in the perception system.
Severity Score: 0.95

These risks highlight the critical need for enhanced sensor capabilities, robust decision-making algorithms, and contingency plans for autonomous vehicles in adverse weather conditions.